% spec §12's stratification example.  The spec lists one valid arrangement
% (blocked in stratum 1, ready in stratum 2); the §37 relaxation computes the
% minimal one, which puts blocked with its positive dependencies in stratum 0.
% What matters, and what this pins, is that ready sits strictly above blocked.
depends(a, b).
unfinished(b).
todo(a).
blocked(X) :- depends(X, Y), unfinished(Y).
ready(X) :- todo(X), not blocked(X).
